    {
      "$kind": "benefits",
      "CardsText": "Atomic | State and event together | \uD83D\uDEE1\uFE0F\nReliable | Nothing lost on a crash | \uD83D\uDCE6\nSimple | A table and a worker | \uD83E\uDDE9\nReady-made | MassTransit, CAP, Wolverine | \uD83D\uDE80",
